---
// Persistent, unobtrusive: distance, phase and the active milestone are the
// answer to "where am I, how far, what phase" from anywhere in the journey.
// It's a supplement, not the only place this information lives — every
// section repeats its own title and distance label in the normal reading
// order, so nothing here is communicated only through the Hud.
---

<aside class="hud" aria-hidden="true">
  <p class="hud-distance"><span id="hud-distance-value">0 km</span></p>
  <p class="hud-route">Earth → Moon</p>
  <p class="hud-milestone">
    <span id="hud-phase">Atmosphere</span><span class="hud-sep"> · </span
    ><span id="hud-title">Earth</span>
  </p>
  <p class="hud-scale-note">Journey scale: logarithmic</p>
</aside>
